                                "sense_id": "5e7fd3c3-4aef-3745-a590-bc8164e871ba",
                                "text": "‘Now,’ said Wardle, and Detective Sergeant Ekwensi clicked out the nib of her pen and prepared to write, ‘does the name Oxana Voloshina mean anything to either of you?’"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "6f293af6-c29c-4a76-a209-ed069decb70c",
                                "sense_id": "5e7fd3c3-4aef-3745-a590-bc8164e871ba",
                                "text": "‘Go and explore the city. And start thinking about your cover name. Oxana Vorontsova’s dead.’"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "42ddf8ac-d835-43c7-9c20-7679e4233331",
                                "sense_id": "5e7fd3c3-4aef-3745-a590-bc8164e871ba",
                                "text": "It has a picture of a woman that I know isn’t me but looks exactly like me with the name ‘Oxana Deseroyova’ on it."
